 "name_en": "Analytics – Purchase Order Visibility and Procurement Spend (2QU)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Analytics – Purchase Order Visibility and Procurement Spend (2QU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides a prebuilt set of Key Performance Indicators for the procurement scenario, allowing analytics that include information from the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> system. Business leaders and decision makers can monitor, simulate, and drive change that show overview and line-item details and provide business context at the same time to uncover hidden insights. These KPIs can be used in different scenarios such as Two Tier and SAC stories.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase customer satisfaction by leveraging the extensibility functionality for better customization of CDS views</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase visibility of costs incurred in the procurement or sourcing area</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Build analytical use case in SAP Analytics Cloud based on <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create analytical reports using view browser</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Extend and create custom analytical query using CDS views</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Extend and create custom CDS views using these consumption views</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__section_d1s_lq5_1dc\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Exclude from Default Activation</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__section_f1s_lq5_1dc\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Reason for Excluding from Default Activation</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">As of the SAP S/4HANA 2025 release, this scope item has been retired and cannot be requested for activation.</p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>分析 - 采购订单可见性和采购支出 (2QU)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目为采购场景提供了一组预构建的关键绩效指标，允许进行包括 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 系统信息的分析。业务主管和决策者可以监控、模拟和推动显示概览和行项目详细信息的变更，同时提供业务上下文以发现隐藏的洞察。这些 KPI 可用于不同的场景，例如两层和 SAC 故事。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">利用可扩展性功能更好地定制 CDS 视图，提高客户满意度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高采购或寻源领域成本的可见性。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在 SAP Analytics Cloud 中基于 SAP <span class=\"ph pname\">S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 数据构建分析用例</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用视图浏览器创建分析报告</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用 CDS 视图扩展和创建自定义分析查询</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用这些消耗视图扩展和创建自定义 CDS 视图</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__section_d1s_lq5_1dc\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">从默认激活中排除</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc6676454bc52484a8df3b03ed24b6de2__section_f1s_lq5_1dc\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">从缺省激活中排除的原因</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">自 SAP S/4HANA 2025 版本起，此范围项目已停用，无法请求激活。</p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
